  62:     - For each wall color, process its 8-connected extra objects from nearest to farthest from the matching wall.
  63:     - Slide each object horizontally toward its matching wall as far as possible without overlapping the wall or an already settled object of the same color.
  64:     - Keep the two vertical wall columns fixed.
  65: 
  66:     Key insight
  67:     - The side columns act like color-specific gravity walls: same-colored objects compact sideways against their own wall while preserving each object's shape.
